# Texting Atlas one-on-one: "atlas" gets the private-chat intro; balances, spending, bills, recent
# transactions and moving money between your own checking and savings are answered by code from your
# connected capital one; anything else goes to the agent (always answered: no speak gate), which can
# plan a solo trip. The banking tools only exist in private chats: a group never sees anyone's balance.
today 2026-10-10 14:00
members maya leo
atlas joins by maya
expect atlas ~ "want to connect your capital one"

dm maya
maya: atlas
expect atlas ~ "in here it's just you and me"
expect atlas ~ "plan a solo trip"
expect atlas ~ "want to connect your capital one"

# Not connected yet: the link, not a guess.
maya: what's my balance
expect atlas ~ "i need your capital one connected first"
expect atlas ~ "here's yours maya 🔒"
expect atlas ~ "/connect/"
maya connects
expect atlas ~ "you're connected ✓"

maya: what's my balance?
expect atlas ~ "your accounts right now"
expect atlas ~ /- checking: \$[\d,]+\.\d\d/
expect atlas ~ /- savings: \$[\d,]+\.\d\d/
expect atlas ~ "charged this month"
maya: how much did i spend this month
expect atlas ~ "last 30 days you spent"
expect atlas ~ "where it went"
maya: what bills are coming up
expect atlas ~ "bills in the next 30 days"
expect atlas ~ "total:"
maya: show me my recent transactions
expect atlas ~ "latest activity"

# Moving money: only between her own accounts, once per message, never more than she has.
maya: move $50 to savings
expect atlas ~ "done ✓ moved $50.00 from checking to savings"
expect sql SELECT from_account, to_account, amount_cents::int AS cents FROM bank_transfers = [{"from_account":"checking","to_account":"savings","cents":5000}]
maya: transfer 99999999 from savings to checking
expect atlas ~ "you've only got"
expect atlas ~ "so i can't move $99,999,999.00"
expect sql SELECT count(*)::int AS n FROM bank_transfers = [{"n":1}]

# Her own budget, in full (it's her chat).
maya: what's my budget?
expect atlas ~ "your trip budget"
expect atlas ~ "based on your last few months of spending"

# Fuzzier asks go to the agent, with the banking tools in reach.
~agent call check_my_bank {"what":"spending","days":7}
maya: ugh i feel broke lately
expect atlas ~ "last 7 days you spent"

# A solo trip: no gate, the agent always answers in a private chat.
~agent text: a solo beach weekend sounds great. when are you thinking, and where are you flying from?
maya: i want to plan a solo beach weekend in november
expect atlas ~ "when are you thinking"
expect sql SELECT count(*)::int AS n FROM llm_traces WHERE role = 'gate' = [{"n":0}]

# The group never gets the banking tools.
group
~agent call check_my_bank {"what":"balance"}
leo: atlas can you check my bank account
expect atlas speaks
expect atlas !~ "your accounts right now"
expect atlas !~ "checking:"
expect transcript !~ /demo|sandbox|nessie|synthetic|simulated/
